  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School food nutrition guidelines for safeguarding children and adolescents`right to food</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Improve children&apos;s and adolescents diets, through the regular consumption of school food that is better aligned with their food and nutrition needs and situation, and through the adoption of health-promoting food practices.
2.	Enhance legal recognition and civil awareness of adequate school meals/food as legal requirements to children&apos;s right to food.</narrative>
  </description>
